4.3 Designing a TAMP Imitation System
In this section, we motivate and describe our TAMP imitation system, OPTIMUS. We distill a privileged TAMP policy into a neural network in order to obtain policies that do not require access to state information, are fast to execute, and react instantaneously. To design OPTIMUS, we apply a TAMP supervisor to a procedural problem generator to produce
