6.3.3 Generalist Policies via Distillation
In order to convert single-object, privileged policies into real world deployable skills, we distill them into multi-object, generalist visuomotor policies using DAgger [223]. Multitask Online Imitation Learning Empirically the standard, off-policy version of
66


